L1: Haptoglobin Phenotype, Preeclampsia Risk and the Efficacy of Vitamin C and E Supplementation to Prevent Preeclampsia in a Racially Diverse Population
L2: PLoS ONE (2013)
L3: Tracey L. Weissgerber, Robin E. Gandley, Paula L. McGee, Catherine Y. Spong, Leslie Myatt, Kenneth J. Leveno, John M. Thorp, Brian M. Mercer, Alan M. Peaceman, Susan M. Ramin, Marshall W. Carpenter, Philip Samuels, Anthony Sciscione, Margaret Harper, Jorge E. Tolosa, George Saade, Yoram Sorokin
